          {
            "id": "test-1",
            "customerName": "Alexandra & James",
            "rating": 5,
            "quote": "Our honeymoon at The Grand Azure was beyond anything we could have imagined. The private villa was stunning, the staff anticipated our every need, and the sunset dinner on the beach was a moment we will cherish forever. Truly paradise on earth."
          },
          {
            "id": "test-2",
            "customerName": "Sophie Laurent",
            "rating": 5,
            "quote": "We celebrated our 10th anniversary here and it was pure magic. The attention to detail, from the rose petals on our bed to the personalized couples massage, made us feel like royalty. The underwater restaurant is an absolute must-experience."
          },
          {
            "id": "test-3",
            "customerName": "Michael Chen",
            "rating": 5,
            "quote": "This was our second visit, and it was even better than the first. The new renovations are exquisite. The privacy here is unmatched - we spent days barely seeing another soul. The butler service elevates the entire experience to a new level of luxury."
          },
